///
/// Contract: `VG.Spec.Rsa.publicCheckedContract`. Constant time but for the public key: timing may depend on the pointers, the lengths and the contents of `n` and `e`, not on the input.
///
/// Public lengths select the limb width. Runtime-modulus Montgomery arithmetic uses 32-bit limbs in the shared public scratch layout. The input acceptance mask is applied after a fixed 64-step exponentiation. Callee-saved registers reside in scratch.
///
/// The function may overwrite the arguments on the stack, as the calling convention lets it.
///
/// # Safety
///
